{"hymn":"S170","parent":"E214","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Conforme a Tu palabra fiel","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—En memoria de Él","syl":{"n1":["Con","i"],"n3":["for","m"],"n4":["me‿a","t"],"n5":"Tu","n6":["pa","i"],"n7":["la","m"],"n8":["bra","t"],"n9":"fiel,","n10":"En","n12":["hu","i"],"n13":["mil","m"],"n14":["dad","t"],"n15":["a","i"],"n16":["quí,","t"],"n18":"Ya","n19":"que","n20":["mo","i"],"n21":["ris","m"],"n22":["te,","t"],"n23":"mi","n24":["Se","i"],"n25":["ñor,","t"],"n27":["Me‿a","i"],"n28":["cor","m"],"n29":["da","m"],"n30":["ré","t"],"n31":"de","n32":"Ti."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Tu cuerpo que quebrado fue,","Mi pan del cielo es;","Tomando de‿esta copa‿así","Yo te recordaré."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["¿Podré‿olvidar Getsemaní,","O Tu conflicto‿allí,","Tu agonía‿y Tu sudor,","Sin recordarte‿a Tí?"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Cuando el Cordero en la cruz","Yo vuelvo a mirar,","Tu sacrificio‿allí por mí","Tengo que recordar."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Recuerdo Tu pena‿y dolor,","Y Tu amor por mí;","En tanto tenga‿aliento yo,","Me‿acordaré de Tí."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Cuando mis labios callen ya,","Sin más memoria‿aquí,","Y vengas en Tu reino, ¡oh,","Acuérdate de mí!"]}]}